  "description": "Microsoft.Data.SqlClient ADO wrapper to make it easy to get dataset, execute stored procedure, or execute sql command with ADO, with resiliency functionality to retry deadlocks and other intermitten db failures. Register the factory to DI as AddYGADO, instantiate DBSPTool with connection string, and call the function by passing sp name and parameters. That's it. It would produce DataSet or execute the SP or SQL command.",
